# Xcode build output. DerivedData is already ignored under ios/, but agents
# building with an explicit -derivedDataPath produce differently-named copies,
# and build logs land beside them. These are megabytes of machine output that
# would otherwise arrive in a worktree merge looking like source.
ios/DerivedData*/
ios/*.log
